# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
#
# Code owners for BAR licensing-critical files.
#
# Any change to the paths below requires review from the licensing maintainer team.
# The CLA bot pushes via CLA_BOT_TOKEN; configure branch protection on `main` to:
#   - Require pull request review from Code Owners for these paths
#   - Allow the CLA bot account (CLA_BOT_TOKEN owner) to bypass that requirement
#     (so automated workflow commits can land without human review)
#
# Replace @beyond-all-reason/licensing-maintainers with the actual team handle
# once that team exists.

# Authoritative signature and assignment ledgers, review flags
.github/cla-signatures.json            @beyond-all-reason/licensing-maintainers
.github/file-license-assignments.json  @beyond-all-reason/licensing-maintainers
license_comments_flags.json            @beyond-all-reason/licensing-maintainers

# Auto-generated per-folder license manifests (any depth)
**/LICENSE_MANIFEST.md                 @beyond-all-reason/licensing-maintainers

# Workflows and policy documents that govern the licensing system
.github/workflows/cla-check.yml        @beyond-all-reason/licensing-maintainers
.github/scripts/                       @beyond-all-reason/licensing-maintainers
.github/licensing.json                 @beyond-all-reason/licensing-maintainers
.github/CODEOWNERS                     @beyond-all-reason/licensing-maintainers
legal/                                 @beyond-all-reason/licensing-maintainers
LICENSES/                              @beyond-all-reason/licensing-maintainers
